<title>USA: Brinker names interim financial officer.</title>
<headline>Brinker names interim financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brinker International said Tuesday it named Russell Owens as interim chief financial officer while the company searches for a permanent replacement.</p>
<p>Russell, the company said in a statement, is filling in for Debra Smithart, who resigned as cfo to pursue broader executive responsibilities.</p>
<p>Brinker said Russell is a 14-year veteran of the restaurant franchiser.</p>
